# Post-onboarding welcome seen — required before Overview checklist

Limited Alpha landlords who finish setup must press **Get Started** on All Set. That writes `ulo.postOnboardingWelcomeSeen.<landlordId>`.

`shouldShowSetupSuccessCard` requires that flag. If it is missing and the landlord can still open Overview / Residents / other admin routes, the **Get set up for success** card never appears — treat as a bug and autofix.

## Rule

| State | Required behavior |
|---|---|
| Setup completed + welcome seen missing | Stay on `/admin/onboarding` (All Set) until Get Started |
| Get Started pressed | Set `ulo.postOnboardingWelcomeSeen.<id>` then navigate to `/admin` |
| Setup completed + welcome seen | Overview may show Get set up for success (unless dismissed / complete) |

## Autofix (Bugbot)

When a PR lets completed Limited Alpha accounts reach `/admin` (or any non-onboarding admin route) while `shouldShowLimitedAlphaPostOnboardingWelcome` would still be true:

1. Redirect with `shouldForcePostOnboardingWelcomeRoute` / equivalent in `AdminOnboardingGuard` — do not only rely on the wizard staying mounted.
2. Keep Get Started as the only writer of the seen flag (`markLimitedAlphaPostOnboardingWelcomeSeen`).
3. Do not weaken `shouldShowSetupSuccessCard` by dropping the `hasSeenLimitedAlphaPostOnboardingWelcome` check to “fix” a missing card.
4. Do not invent a second localStorage key for the same gate.

## Where it lives

- Flag helpers: `src/lib/postOnboardingWelcome.ts` (`hasSeen…`, `mark…`, `shouldShow…`, `shouldForcePostOnboardingWelcomeRoute`)
- Guard redirect: `src/components/AdminOnboardingGuard.tsx`
- Get Started CTA: `OnboardingWizardShell` → `OnboardingAllSetWelcome`
- Checklist gate: `shouldShowSetupSuccessCard` in `setupSuccessChecklist.ts`

## Do not

- Allow Overview when `ulo.postOnboardingWelcomeSeen` is absent after completed setup
- Clear the seen flag on normal navigation (only onboarding reset may clear it)
- Show Get set up for success by skipping the welcome-seen prerequisite
